ecause of  our jobs right and then there's stories  that our heart tells us that we have to  cover and for maria this is one of those  yeah just watching that i mean you  couldn't help but  i mean marae is such a real  person love her i think that was a great  piece and you just understand it's  difficult to cover that type of stuff  but as she said it's humanity and all of  us bringing our different unique  perspectives to the stories we cover and  it's tough not to get lost in that  humanity yeah when you're seeing these  families in so much pain going through  what they've been through definitely a  good job well done great job maria
 

